nction}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcProb4MixingSequence}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcProb4MixingSequence}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}prob4\\text{-}mixing\\text{-}sequence}\\vdash\\mathrm{ZfcProb4MixingSequence}_S(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,\\vec A)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\mathbb P,\\Omega,\\mathcal F)\\land\\mathbb P(\\Omega)=1\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec A,\\omega,\\mathcal F)\\land\\forall B\\in\\mathcal F\\;\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists N\\in\\omega\\;\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\left(N\\leq n\\to\\left|\\mathbb P(\\vec A(n)\\cap B)-\\mathbb P(\\vec A(n))\\mathbb P(B)\\right|&lt;\\varepsilon\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}prob4\\text{-}mixing\\text{-}sequence}\\vdash\\mathrm{ZfcProb4MixingSequence}_S(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,\\vec A)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\mathbb P,\\Omega,\\mathcal F)\\land\\mathbb P(\\Omega)=1\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec A,\\omega,\\mathcal F)\\land\\forall B\\in\\mathcal F\\;\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists N\\in\\omega\\;\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\left(N\\leq n\\to\\left|\\mathbb P(\\vec A(n)\\cap B)-\\mathbb P(\\vec A(n))\\mathbb P(B)\\right|&lt;\\varepsilon\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Mixing is stated as convergence of the correlation difference to zero, without separately assuming two limits exist.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a334